    "title": "Wreaths Across America Escort to Honor Veterans with 24-Mile Tribute - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Radio Pacific, Inc ,\n11 hours ago PORT ANGELES — A 24-mile patriotic procession will roll through the North Olympic Peninsula on Thursday, delivering more than 1,300 wreaths to honor veterans. The Wreaths Across America Honor Escort, organized by the Michael Trebert Chapter of the Daughters of the American Revolution, will stretch from 7 Cedars Casino to Mt. Angeles Memorial Park. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
